ith WtF system</u>. This could be easy and interesting enough to try. design a couple alternative forms (small crab/buff crabman) with appropriate buffs. No dexterity buff, but get sweet armor viable against bullets. No regen, but ability to 'molt' with some tie and essence healing to full health and removing physical crippling effects. No effect by silver, but allergic to pure salt (not seawater) or maybe to modern solvants that deal aggro in similar manner. No normal fetishes but the art of using something like fetish tattoos. Also, no ability to sidestep normally, but can turn sufficiently deep water into a tunnel to the other side (which one?). As for the supernatural powers... could pretty much mirror werewolves with marine twist or do as with brineborn, a mix of numina and mutation merits. <br /> For the fluff, probably reverse the process. Not a big fan of those ancient spirit/gods dominating the whole splat. I was thinking to make it a historically disjointed sub-splat living mostly solitary or small family units along the coasts in hotter climates. with their own varied myths, but no &amp;quot;one and true&amp;quot; origin, coming together only with the modern advent of communication and transportation. <br /> <br /> So what do you think, worth it to write up the splat or one of the other 4 choices already do it well enough? would it be interesting?</div> </div> </div> </div>Maybe a crab Host from Werewolf ?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24346-neos01","name":"Neos01","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24346_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1021"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-31T12:13:32-07:00","id":1377551,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\