t to DTRPG about it.<br /> <br /> EDIT: Hm, spoke too soon. The file I downloaded has the right name, but I'm still seeing two edges that target Composure on page 50. We'll see what DTRPG says when they get back to me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":13641,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13641-mad_maudlin","user":"Mad_Maudlin","date":". 01-30-2021, 04:41 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13641-mad_maudlin","name":"Mad_Maudlin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"229"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-10T11:23:34-07:00","id":1443384,"title":"","content":"Does anything give guidelines for how high Speed interacts with footchase contested actions?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-10T14:43:37-07:00","id":1443401,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/864699-ask-a-simpl